data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Validated recipe — aave-v3@3.7.0\n\n⚠ Version disagreement: this recipe was validated against `aave-v3@3.7.0`, while the units below are labelled `aave-v3@3.6.0`. Both are stated rather than reconciled — a recipe's stamp records what was actually run, and a unit's label records what the corpus holds. Differences inside one major are not always cosmetic: check the recipe's own pins before copying it against these units.\n_human-validated 2026-08-11 by farseen (github: FarseenSh)_\n_source: recipes/aave-v3/supply-borrow.yaml_\n\n**Receipts** — what was actually run, on 2026-08-11, by farseen (github: FarseenSh)\n- checks: attest, test, fork\n- chains exercised: ethereum, base, arbitrum\n- on-chain:\n  - none recorded — this row exercises no chain, or its run broadcast nothing. A stated absence, never a gap: the receipt for such a row IS the suite result.\n\n# Recipe: aave-v3 @3 :: supply-borrow\n# STATUS: ✅ VALIDATED — first 2026-08-08 (10 assertions), re-dated 2026-08-11 after a second curator run covered the amendment: 11/11 including S10. Run by farseen (github: FarseenSh) both times. ⚠ THREE CHAINS VERIFIED, ONE CHAIN EXERCISED — see the stamp caveat below.\nproject_id: \"aave-v3\"       # LOCKED P1 id — brands the major, kept per SCHEMA-DEPARTURES §2\nversion_major: 3            # the coexisting-majors key. v4 is LIVE; see v4_coexistence_note.\nversion: \"3.7.0\"            # the exact release authored against; deployed as POOL_REVISION 11\ntype: \"supply-borrow\"\n\n# Verified on all three by S0. See the stamp caveat above for what that does and does not mean.\nchains: [ethereum, base, arbitrum]\n\n# ── DEPLOYMENTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# From aave-dao/aave-address-book at the pinned commit, then verified on-chain TWO ways:\n#   (a) the Pool's own ADDRESSES_PROVIDER() equals the book's POOL_ADDRESSES_PROVIDER, and\n#   (b) that provider's getPool() round-trips back to the same Pool address.\n# A single lookup that agrees with itself is not a verification; these are two directions.\ndeployments:\n  ethereum:\n    pool: \"0x87870Bca3F3fD6335C3F4ce8392D69350B4fA4E2\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0x2f39d218133AFaB8F2B819B1066c7E434Ad94E9e\"\n    oracle: \"0x54586bE62E3c3580375aE3723C145253060Ca0C2\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E1-pool-ethereum\"\n  base:\n    pool: \"0xA238Dd80C259a72e81d7e4664a9801593F98d1c5\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0xe20fCBdBfFC4Dd138cE8b2E6FBb6CB49777ad64D\"\n    oracle: \"0x2Cc0Fc26eD4563A5ce5e8bdcfe1A2878676Ae156\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E2-pool-base\"\n  arbitrum:\n    pool: \"0x794a61358D6845594F94dc1DB02A252b5b4814aD\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0xa97684ead0e402dC232d5A977953DF7ECBaB3CDb\"\n    oracle: \"0xb56c2F0B653B2e0b10C9b928C8580Ac5Df02C7C7\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E3-pool-arbitrum\"\n\n# ── WORKING EXAMPLE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Runs verbatim as test/aave-v3/supply-borrow.t.sol stage S9. Deliberately borrows the SAME\n# asset it supplies: that makes the example price-independent and therefore reproducible on\n# any fork at any block, which a WETH-collateral example is not. See scope_notes.\nworking_example:\n  source_protocol: \"aave-v3\"\n  source_url: \"https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol\"\n  code: |\n    // SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n    pragma solidity ^0.8.24;\n\n    interface IERC20 {\n      function approve(address spender, uint256 amount) external returns (bool);\n      function balanceOf(address account) external view returns (uint256);\n    }\n\n    interface IPool {\n      function supply(address asset, uint256 amount, address onBehalfOf, uint16 referralCode) external;\n      function borrow(address asset, uint256 amount, uint256 interestRateMode,\n                      uint16 referralCode, address onBehalfOf) external;\n      function getUserAccountData(address user) external view returns (\n        uint256 totalCollateralBase, uint256 totalDebtBase, uint256 availableBorrowsBase,\n        uint256 currentLiquidationThreshold, uint256 ltv, uint256 healthFactor);\n      function POOL_REVISION() external view returns (uint256);\n    }\n\n    contract AaveV3SupplyBorrow {\n      // Ethereum mainnet. For base / arbitrum see `deployments`.\n      address constant POOL = 0x87870Bca3F3fD6335C3F4ce8392D69350B4fA4E2;\n      address constant USDC = 0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48;\n\n      uint256 constant VARIABLE = 2;   // interestRateMode. 1 is deprecated and REVERTS.\n\n      function supplyThenBorrow(uint256 supplyAmount, uint256 borrowAmount) external {\n        // 0. Check WHICH Aave you are talking to before trusting anything else.\n        //    The address is a proxy and is stable across upgrades; the revision is not.\n        require(IPool(POOL).POOL_REVISION() == 11, \"not Aave v3.7.0 - re-read the recipe\");\n\n        // 1. Approve the POOL (not the aToken) to pull the underlying.\n        IERC20(USDC).approve(POOL, supplyAmount);\n\n        // 2. Supply. aTokens are minted 1:1 to `onBehalfOf`, and the first supply of an\n        //    asset with non-zero LTV also enables it as collateral.\n        IPool(POOL).supply(USDC, supplyAmount, address(this), 0);\n\n        // 3. Borrow against it. Note the parameter order is NOT supply()'s:\n        //    onBehalfOf is LAST here, and interestRateMode sits third.\n        IPool(POOL).borrow(USDC, borrowAmount, VARIABLE, 0, address(this));\n      }\n\n      /// Values are in the ORACLE's base currency: USD with 8 decimals, NOT USDC's 6.\n      /// A $5,000 collateral position reads as 5000_00000000, not 5000_000000.\n      function positionUsd() external view returns (uint256 collateralUsd8, uint256 debtUsd8, uint256 healthFactor) {\n        (collateralUsd8, debtUsd8, , , , healthFactor) = IPool(POOL).getUserAccountData(address(this));\n      }\n    }\n\n# ── INTERFACE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n_… recipe truncated for budget — 40794 bytes total, full text at the source path above._\n_Continue it: `web3_fetch` with `cursor: \"recipe:aave-v3@3.7.0::supply-borrow::body@5121\"` — each call returns the next slice and the next cursor until there is none._\n\n**Citations** (preserved through truncation — degrade bodies, never citations):\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/protocol/libraries/types/DataTypes.sol#L153\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/v3.3.0/src/contracts/protocol/libraries/helpers/Errors.sol\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L407\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-address-book/blob/24806942652ac4543cb237dc028ac6413b242eb1/src/AaveV3EthereumHorizon.sol\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L738\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L204\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/issues/194\n- https://etherscan.io/address/0xCca852Bc40e560adC3b1Cc58CA5b55638ce826c9\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-address-book/blob/24806942652ac4543cb237dc028ac6413b242eb1/src/AaveV4Ethereum.sol\n- https://github.com/aave/aave-sdk.git\n- https://github.com/aave/aave-v4-sdk#initial-setup\n- https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/protocol/tokenization/AToken.sol#L133\n- https://github.com/aave/aave-v3-core`,\n- https://api.github.com/repos/aave/aave-v3-core\n\n---\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::Setup::_setUp\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/invariants/Setup.t.sol#L29-L82\n\n```\nusing MarketReportUtils for MarketReport;\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::WrappedTokenGatewayTests::aaveOracle\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/helpers/WrappedTokenGateway.t.sol#L16-L50\n\n```\nAaveOracle internal aaveOracle;\nWrappedTokenGatewayV3 internal wrappedTokenGatewayV3;\nAToken internal aWEth;\nVariableDebtToken internal wEthVariableDebtToken;\nAToken internal aUsdx;\nVariableDebtToken internal usdxVariableDebtToken;\nuint256 internal depositSize = 5e18;\n+2 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### be820cee-03b3-5be6-89fe-762ac26252ff\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/docs/3.7/Aave-v3.7-changelog.md#L3-L3\n\n```\nAave v3.7 Changelog › Core Contracts\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::MarketReportUtils::__contract__~2\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/src/deployments/contracts/utilities/MarketReportUtils.sol#L7-L28\n\n```\ntoContractsReport(\n    MarketReport memory report\n  ) internal pure returns (ContractsReport memory contractsReport) {\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::BatchTestProcedures::DeployCoreAndPeripheryVariables\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/utils/BatchTestProcedures.sol#L51-L90\n\n```\nstruct DeployCoreAndPeripheryVariables\nstruct DeployAndSetupVariables\naddress poolAdmin;\n(3 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::BatchTestProcedures::__contract__~3\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/utils/BatchTestProcedures.sol#L134-L181\n\n```\n{\n    DeployAndSetupVariables memory variables;\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::AaveV3SetupBatch::_initialReport\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/src/deployments/projects/aave-v3-batched/batches/AaveV3SetupBatch.sol#L9-L63\n\n```\nInitialReport internal _initialReport;\nSetupReport internal _setupReport;\nconstructor(\nfunction setupAaveV3Market(\nfunction setMarketReport(MarketReport memory marketReport) external onlyOwner\n+3 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::AaveV3MockCollateralUpdateLtZeroLiqProtocolFeeOnly::__contract__\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/extensions/v3-config-engine/mocks/AaveV3MockCollateralUpdateLtZeroLiqProtocolFeeOnly.sol#L13-L37\n\n```\ncontract AaveV3MockCollateralUpdateLtZeroLiqProtocolFeeOnly is AaveV3Payload {\n  address public immutable ASSET_ADDRESS;\n```\n\n### b8a3dd02-f56d-5504-8036-06eddd0d973c\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/docs/3.7/Aave-v3.7-changelog.md#L31-L37\n\n```\nAave v3.7 Changelog › Core Contracts › ValidationLogic\n- Removed `MINIMUM_HEALTH_FACTOR_LIQUIDATION_THRESHOLD` (sentinel-related). See [sentinel-removal.md](sentinel-removal.md).\n- Removed `priceOracleSentinel` parameter from `validateLiquidationCall` and `validateBorrow`. See…\n```\n\n### aave-v3@3.6.0::AaveV3ConfigEngineTest::testRateStrategiesUpdates\n`aave-v3@3.6.0` · ⚠ version_defaulted · repo:fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b · as_of 2026-06-19T10:06:02Z\nhttps://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/extensions/v3-config-engine/AaveV3ConfigEngineTest.t.sol#L698-L724\n\n```\nfunction testRateStrategiesUpdates() public {\n    address asset = tokenList.usdx;\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"integrate","recipe":{"project_id":"aave-v3","version":"3.7.0","recipe_type":"supply-borrow","last_validated":"2026-08-11","validated_by":"farseen (github: FarseenSh)","receipts":{"validated_on":"2026-08-11","validated_by":"farseen (github: FarseenSh)","checks":["attest","test","fork"],"chains_exercised":["ethereum","base","arbitrum"],"on_chain":"none recorded — this row exercises no chain, or its run broadcast nothing. A stated absence, never a gap: the receipt for such a row IS the suite result."},"body":"# Recipe: aave-v3 @3 :: supply-borrow\n# STATUS: ✅ VALIDATED — first 2026-08-08 (10 assertions), re-dated 2026-08-11 after a second curator run covered the amendment: 11/11 including S10. Run by farseen (github: FarseenSh) both times. ⚠ THREE CHAINS VERIFIED, ONE CHAIN EXERCISED — see the stamp caveat below.\nproject_id: \"aave-v3\"       # LOCKED P1 id — brands the major, kept per SCHEMA-DEPARTURES §2\nversion_major: 3            # the coexisting-majors key. v4 is LIVE; see v4_coexistence_note.\nversion: \"3.7.0\"            # the exact release authored against; deployed as POOL_REVISION 11\ntype: \"supply-borrow\"\n\n# Verified on all three by S0. See the stamp caveat above for what that does and does not mean.\nchains: [ethereum, base, arbitrum]\n\n# ── DEPLOYMENTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# From aave-dao/aave-address-book at the pinned commit, then verified on-chain TWO ways:\n#   (a) the Pool's own ADDRESSES_PROVIDER() equals the book's POOL_ADDRESSES_PROVIDER, and\n#   (b) that provider's getPool() round-trips back to the same Pool address.\n# A single lookup that agrees with itself is not a verification; these are two directions.\ndeployments:\n  ethereum:\n    pool: \"0x87870Bca3F3fD6335C3F4ce8392D69350B4fA4E2\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0x2f39d218133AFaB8F2B819B1066c7E434Ad94E9e\"\n    oracle: \"0x54586bE62E3c3580375aE3723C145253060Ca0C2\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E1-pool-ethereum\"\n  base:\n    pool: \"0xA238Dd80C259a72e81d7e4664a9801593F98d1c5\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0xe20fCBdBfFC4Dd138cE8b2E6FBb6CB49777ad64D\"\n    oracle: \"0x2Cc0Fc26eD4563A5ce5e8bdcfe1A2878676Ae156\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E2-pool-base\"\n  arbitrum:\n    pool: \"0x794a61358D6845594F94dc1DB02A252b5b4814aD\"\n    pool_addresses_provider: \"0xa97684ead0e402dC232d5A977953DF7ECBaB3CDb\"\n    oracle: \"0xb56c2F0B653B2e0b10C9b928C8580Ac5Df02C7C7\"\n    pool_revision: 11\n    evidence_id: \"E3-pool-arbitrum\"\n\n# ── WORKING EXAMPLE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Runs verbatim as test/aave-v3/supply-borrow.t.sol stage S9. Deliberately borrows the SAME\n# asset it supplies: that makes the example price-independent and therefore reproducible on\n# any fork at any block, which a WETH-collateral example is not. See scope_notes.\nworking_example:\n  source_protocol: \"aave-v3\"\n  source_url: \"https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol\"\n  code: |\n    // SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n    pragma solidity ^0.8.24;\n\n    interface IERC20 {\n      function approve(address spender, uint256 amount) external returns (bool);\n      function balanceOf(address account) external view returns (uint256);\n    }\n\n    interface IPool {\n      function supply(address asset, uint256 amount, address onBehalfOf, uint16 referralCode) external;\n      function borrow(address asset, uint256 amount, uint256 interestRateMode,\n                      uint16 referralCode, address onBehalfOf) external;\n      function getUserAccountData(address user) external view returns (\n        uint256 totalCollateralBase, uint256 totalDebtBase, uint256 availableBorrowsBase,\n        uint256 currentLiquidationThreshold, uint256 ltv, uint256 healthFactor);\n      function POOL_REVISION() external view returns (uint256);\n    }\n\n    contract AaveV3SupplyBorrow {\n      // Ethereum mainnet. For base / arbitrum see `deployments`.\n      address constant POOL = 0x87870Bca3F3fD6335C3F4ce8392D69350B4fA4E2;\n      address constant USDC = 0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48;\n\n      uint256 constant VARIABLE = 2;   // interestRateMode. 1 is deprecated and REVERTS.\n\n      function supplyThenBorrow(uint256 supplyAmount, uint256 borrowAmount) external {\n        // 0. Check WHICH Aave you are talking to before trusting anything else.\n        //    The address is a proxy and is stable across upgrades; the revision is not.\n        require(IPool(POOL).POOL_REVISION() == 11, \"not Aave v3.7.0 - re-read the recipe\");\n\n        // 1. Approve the POOL (not the aToken) to pull the underlying.\n        IERC20(USDC).approve(POOL, supplyAmount);\n\n        // 2. Supply. aTokens are minted 1:1 to `onBehalfOf`, and the first supply of an\n        //    asset with non-zero LTV also enables it as collateral.\n        IPool(POOL).supply(USDC, supplyAmount, address(this), 0);\n\n        // 3. Borrow against it. Note the parameter order is NOT supply()'s:\n        //    onBehalfOf is LAST here, and interestRateMode sits third.\n        IPool(POOL).borrow(USDC, borrowAmount, VARIABLE, 0, address(this));\n      }\n\n      /// Values are in the ORACLE's base currency: USD with 8 decimals, NOT USDC's 6.\n      /// A $5,000 collateral position reads as 5000_00000000, not 5000_000000.\n      function positionUsd() external view returns (uint256 collateralUsd8, uint256 debtUsd8, uint256 healthFactor) {\n        (collateralUsd8, debtUsd8, , , , healthFactor) = IPool(POOL).getUserAccountData(address(this));\n      }\n    }\n\n# ── INTERFACE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","source_path":"recipes/aave-v3/supply-borrow.yaml","requested_version":null,"exact_version_match":null,"body_truncated":true,"body_bytes":40794,"citations":["https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/protocol/libraries/types/DataTypes.sol#L153","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/v3.3.0/src/contracts/protocol/libraries/helpers/Errors.sol","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L407","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-address-book/blob/24806942652ac4543cb237dc028ac6413b242eb1/src/AaveV3EthereumHorizon.sol","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L738","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/interfaces/IPool.sol#L204","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/issues/194","https://etherscan.io/address/0xCca852Bc40e560adC3b1Cc58CA5b55638ce826c9","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-address-book/blob/24806942652ac4543cb237dc028ac6413b242eb1/src/AaveV4Ethereum.sol","https://github.com/aave/aave-sdk.git","https://github.com/aave/aave-v4-sdk#initial-setup","https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/cff15de6d1271b0c800fc001f4aea4c263e8a597/src/contracts/protocol/tokenization/AToken.sol#L133","https://github.com/aave/aave-v3-core`,","https://api.github.com/repos/aave/aave-v3-core"],"citations_capped":false,"body_cursor":"recipe:aave-v3@3.7.0::supply-borrow::body@5121","version_note":"⚠ Version disagreement: this recipe was validated against `aave-v3@3.7.0`, while the units below are labelled `aave-v3@3.6.0`. Both are stated rather than reconciled — a recipe's stamp records what was actually run, and a unit's label records what the corpus holds. Differences inside one major are not always cosmetic: check the recipe's own pins before copying it against these units."},"hits":[{"selector":"aave-v3@3.6.0::Setup::_setUp","source_url":"https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/invariants/Setup.t.sol#L29-L82","snippet":"using MarketReportUtils for MarketReport;","project":"aave-v3","version":"3.6.0","version_defaulted":true,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-06-19T10:06:02Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b"},{"selector":"aave-v3@3.6.0::WrappedTokenGatewayTests::aaveOracle","source_url":"https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b/tests/helpers/WrappedTokenGateway.t.sol#L16-L50","snippet":"AaveOracle internal aaveOracle;\nWrappedTokenGatewayV3 internal wrappedTokenGatewayV3;\nAToken internal aWEth;\nVariableDebtToken internal wEthVariableDebtToken;\nAToken internal aUsdx;\nVariableDebtToken internal usdxVariableDebtToken;\nuint256 internal depositSize = 5e18;\n+2 more units in this chunk","project":"aave-v3","version":"3.6.0","version_defaulted":true,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-06-19T10:06:02Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9cee45b4acf912ae84f5b"},{"selector":"be820cee-03b3-5be6-89fe-762ac26252ff","source_url":"https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/fd1fbd9150426ca8ace9c